tdda examples [module] [directory]


Write out example code and data for a particular module
(referencetest, constraints or rexpy), to the specified
directory


If no module is specified, examples for all three are written out.


If no output directory is specified, the examples are
written to a subdirectory of the current directory.


To write out all of the examples for all three modules to
subdirectories within the current directory, just use:

                      tdda examples

